      "level": 2,
      "content": "Introduction"
    },
    {
      "type": "keyFacts",
      "title": "Key Takeaways",
      "items": [
        "Child Health Nursing emphasizes systematic monitoring of growth and development stages.",
        "Tracking pediatric growth milestones is vital for early identification of developmental delays.",
        "Knowledge of basic immunization schedules is essential for preventive pediatric healthcare.",
        "Specialized nursing care protocols are required for managing common childhood diseases and sick children.",
        "Neonatal care forms a fundamental pillar of pediatric nursing practice in competitive clinical exams."
      ],
      "id": "9c5nd6m"
